The following files under src/vllm_moe_surgeon/store/ are a verbatim lift from a
vLLM fork (branch disk-tier-proto), with only their import paths rewritten
(`vllm.envs` -> `vllm_moe_surgeon.env`, `vllm.logger` ->
`vllm_moe_surgeon._logging`, and sibling-module imports). They carry the
`SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project` header:

  - store/expert_weight_provider.py
  - store/expert_disk_store.py
  - store/expert_load_pipeline.py
  - store/expert_policy.py
  - store/expert_zero_copy.py

These are kept byte-comparable to their upstream source on purpose (see README
"Layout" and pyproject.toml, which exempts store/*.py from two lint rules rather
than reformatting the lift). Modifications to their behaviour are made in the
fork first and re-lifted, so this attribution stays accurate.
